WEBVTT

00:08:27.202 --> 00:08:30.408
that we know are associated
with cancer and lung disease

00:08:30.432 --> 00:08:31.641
and heart disease,

00:08:31.665 --> 00:08:34.098
they were also sucking down
asbestos fibers.

00:08:34.112 --> 00:08:35.112
(Gasps)

00:08:36.236 --> 00:08:38.791
In the 1960s and the 1970s,

00:08:38.815 --> 00:08:42.339
the so-called innovation
was the light cigarette.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.969
This is a typical brand
of the day called True.

00:08:47.477 --> 00:08:50.914
And this is after the Surgeon General's
reports have started coming out.

00:08:50.938 --> 00:08:53.247
And you see the look
of concern on her face.

00:08:53.271 --> 00:08:54.583
[Considering all I'd heard,

00:08:54.607 --> 00:08:57.403
I decided to either quit
or smoke True.

00:08:57.427 --> 00:08:58.833
I smoke True.]

00:08:58.857 --> 00:09:00.395
(Laughter)